sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SDB@{ "type" : "database" } as Sender DB
    participant S as Sender
    participant R as Receiver
    participant RDB@{ "type" : "database" } as Receiver DB

    S->>SDB: Find visible messages eligible for offering
    SDB-->>S: messageId list
    S->>R: OFFER(messageId₁ ... messageIdₙ)

    R->>RDB: Check each offered ID

    alt Message is already present and visible
        RDB-->>R: Message already known
        R->>R: Queue acknowledgement
        R->>S: ACK(messageId)
        S->>SDB: Mark message as seen by Reciver node
    else Message is unknown
        R->>RDB: Store message ID as offered
        R->>RDB: Generate request and remove pending offer entry
        R->>S: REQUEST(messageId)

        S->>SDB: Verify message is visible to Receiver node
        S->>SDB: Mark message as requested
        SDB-->>S: Requested message
        S->>R: MESSAGE(groupId, timestamp, body)

        R->>R: Recompute messageId
        R->>RDB: Check group visibility
        R->>RDB: Store message or update existing entry
        R->>R: Queue acknowledgement
        R->>S: ACK(messageId)

        S->>SDB: Mark message as seen by Receiver node
    end
